      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "100% agree, this is a huge issue with something we are developing right now as when you are in a station, your velocity is still allowed to accumulate, and we have no way of knowing you are in a station, so if you get out of the station after we have applied velocity, it will just fling you",
